<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Desh News — Independent. Fearless. 24/7.</title>
<meta name="description" content="Desh News — breaking news, national, international, politics, economy, sports and entertainment coverage 24/7." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+Bengali:wght@400;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --red:#d0021b; --red-dark:#a80116;
    --ink:#0f172a; --body:#334155; --muted:#64748b;
    --line:#e2e8f0; --bg:#ffffff; --surface:#f8fafc; --card:#ffffff;
    --shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(15,23,42,.06), 0 10px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.07);
    --radius:14px; --max:1200px;
  }
  [data-theme="dark"]{
    --ink:#f1f5f9; --body:#cbd5e1; --muted:#94a3b8;
    --line:#1e293b; --bg:#0b1220; --surface:#111c2e; --card:#0f1a2b;
    --shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4), 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{
    margin:0; background:var(--bg); color:var(--body);
    font-family:'Inter','Noto Sans Bengali',system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;
    line-height:1.55; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  img{display:block;max-width:100%}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
  button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:none;color:inherit}
  .container{width:100%;max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}

  /* ---------- Top bar ---------- */
  .topbar{background:#0b1220;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:13px}
  .topbar .container{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;height:40px}
  .topbar a:hover{color:#fff}
  .topbar .links{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}
  .topbar .sep{opacity:.35}
  .socials{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
  .socials a{display:inline-flex;width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:50%;background:#1e293b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}
  .socials a:hover{background:var(--red)}

  /* ---------- Header ---------- */
  .site-header{background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .header-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;height:84px}
  .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-shrink:0}
  .logo-mark{
    width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--red);
    display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:900;
    box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(208,2,27,.35);
  }
  .logo-text{font-weight:900;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:-.5px;color:var(--ink);line-height:1}
  .logo-text span{color:var(--red)}
  .logo-text small{display:block;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.6px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .header-actions{margin-left:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
  .search{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 14px;width:250px}
  .search input{border:0;background:none;outline:none;width:100%;color:var(--ink);font-size:14px}
  .icon-btn{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink)}
  .icon-btn:hover{border-color:var(--red);color:var(--red)}
  .live-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.6px;padding:11px 16px;border-radius:12px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .live-btn:hover{background:var(--red-dark)}
  .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;animation:pulse 1.4s infinite}
  @keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}50%{opacity:.35;transform:scale(.8)}}

  /* ---------- Nav ---------- */
  .nav-wrap{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .main-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;height:52px;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none}
  .main-nav::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
  .main-nav a{
    padding:0 14px;height:52px;display:flex;align-items:center;
    font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.3px;text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--ink);border-bottom:3px solid transparent;white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .main-nav a:hover{color:var(--red)}
  .main-nav a.active{color:var(--red);border-bottom-color:var(--red)}
  .menu-btn{display:none}

  /* ---------- Ticker ---------- */
  .ticker{background:#0f172a;color:#e2e8f0;overflow:hidden;border-bottom:3px solid var(--red)}
  .ticker .container{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0;height:44px;padding:0}
  .ticker-label{
    background:var(--red);color:#fff;font-weight:900;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;
    padding:0 16px;height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;flex-shrink:0;text-transform:uppercase;
  }
  .ticker-viewport{overflow:hidden;flex:1;position:relative}
  .ticker-track{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:scroll 38s linear infinite}
  .ticker:hover .ticker-track{animation-play-state:paused}
  .ticker-item{margin-right:44px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
  .ticker-item::before{content:"";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--red);flex-shrink:0}
  @keyframes scroll{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}

  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
  .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.65fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin:26px 0 34px}
  .lead{
    position:relative;border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;min-height:480px;
    display:flex;align-items:flex-end;box-shadow:var(--shadow);background:#111;
  }
  .lead img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .6s ease}
  .lead:hover img{transform:scale(1.04)}
  .lead::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(0,0,0,.92) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,.45) 45%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 78%)}
  .lead-body{position:relative;z-index:2;padding:28px;color:#fff}
  .tag{display:inline-block;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:6px;text-transform:uppercase}
  .lead h1{font-size:clamp(24px,3.2vw,38px);line-height:1.15;margin:14px 0 10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.6px}
  .lead p{margin:0 0 14px;color:#d7dee8;font-size:15.5px;max-width:60ch}
  .meta{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);flex-wrap:wrap}
  .lead .meta{color:#c7d0db}
  .meta b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}
  .lead .meta b{color:#fff}
  .side{display:grid;grid-template-rows:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}
  .side-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .side-card .thumb{height:132px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--surface)}
  .side-card img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .5s}
  .side-card:hover img{transform:scale(1.05)}
  .side-card .body{padding:14px 16px 16px}
  .side-card .cat{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--red);text-transform:uppercase}
  .side-card h3{font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;margin:6px 0 8px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:800;
    display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}

  /* ---------- Layout ---------- */
  .content-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 340px;gap:34px;padding-bottom:60px}
  .section-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:0 0 18px}
  .section-head::before{content:"";width:5px;height:26px;background:var(--red);border-radius:3px}
  .section-head h2{font-size:22px;margin:0;color:var(--ink);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.3px}
  .section-head a{margin-left:auto;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--red)}

  .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:22px}
  .article-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow);transition:transform .25s,box-shadow .25s}
  .article-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(15,23,42,.14)}
  .article-card .thumb{aspect-ratio:16/9;overflow:hidden;background:var(--surface)}
  .article-card img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .5s}
  .article-card:hover img{transform:scale(1.06)}
  .article-card .body{padding:16px 18px 18px}
  .cat{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--red);text-transform:uppercase}
  .article-card h3{font-size:17.5px;line-height:1.32;margin:7px 0 10px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.2px}
  .article-card p{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);
    display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}
  .hide{display:none !important}

  .load-more{display:block;margin:28px auto 38px;padding:13px 30px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);font-weight:800;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink);background:var(--card)}
  .load-more:hover{border-color:var(--red);color:var(--red)}

  /* ---------- Video ---------- */
  .video-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}
  .video-card{position:relative;border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:4/3;background:#111;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .video-card img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:.85;transition:transform .5s,opacity .3s}
  .video-card:hover img{transform:scale(1.06);opacity:1}
  .play{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center}
  .play span{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(208,2,27,.92);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:18px;padding-left:3px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
  .video-card .vlabel{position:absolute;left:12px;bottom:12px;color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;text-shadow:0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.8);right:12px;
    display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}

  /* ---------- Sidebar ---------- */
  .sidebar{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:26px}
  .widget{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .widget h3{margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;font-weight:900;color:var(--ink);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
  .widget h3::before{content:"";width:4px;height:18px;background:var(--red);border-radius:2px}
  .trend{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
  .trend li{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start}
  .trend .num{font-size:30px;font-weight:900;line-height:1;color:var(--red);opacity:.9;min-width:34px}
  .trend a{font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.35}
  .trend a:hover{color:var(--red)}
  .trend small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;font-size:12px;margin-top:3px}

  .newsletter{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);color:#e2e8f0;border:0}
  .newsletter h3{color:#fff}
  .newsletter h3::before{background:var(--red)}
  .newsletter p{font-size:13.5px;color:#a9b6c6;margin:0 0 14px}
  .newsletter input{width:100%;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #334155;background:#0b1220;color:#fff;outline:none;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:14px}
  .newsletter input:focus{border-color:var(--red)}
  .newsletter button{width:100%;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font-weight:800;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:13px}
  .newsletter button:hover{background:var(--red-dark)}

  .tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
  .tags a{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--body)}
  .tags a:hover{border-color:var(--red);color:var(--red)}

  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */
  footer{background:#0b1220;color:#94a3b8;padding:54px 0 0;margin-top:10px}
  .foot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:34px;padding-bottom:40px}
  .foot-brand .logo-text{color:#fff;font-size:24px}
  .foot-brand .logo-text span{color:var(--red)}
  .foot-brand .logo-text small{color:#64748b}
  .foot-brand p{font-size:13.5px;max-width:34ch;margin:16px 0 0}
  footer h4{color:#fff;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1.2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:4px 0 16px}
  footer ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;font-size:14px}
  footer ul a:hover{color:#fff}
  .foot-bottom{border-top:1px solid #1e293b;padding:18px 0;font-size:12.5px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}

  /* ---------- Back to top ---------- */
  .to-top{position:fixed;right:20px;bottom:20px;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--red);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:18px;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(208,2,27,.4);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .3s,transform .3s;z-index:70}
  .to-top.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
  .to-top:hover{transform:translateY(-3px)}

  /* ---------- Modal ---------- */
  .modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(15,23,42,.8);display:none;place-items:center;padding:20px;z-index:100}
  .modal-backdrop.open{display:grid}
  .modal{background:var(--card);color:var(--body);max-width:720px;width:100%;max-height:90vh;overflow-y:auto;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 25px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.5);position:relative}
  .modal-close{position:sticky;top:14px;float:right;margin:14px;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(0,0,0,.65);color:#fff;font-size:20px;display:grid;place-items:center;z-index:5}
  .modal-body{padding:24px 28px 32px;clear:both}
  .modal-body h2{color:var(--ink);font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;margin:10px 0 14px}
  .modal-body img{width:100%;border-radius:10px;margin:16px 0;max-height:360px;object-fit:cover}
  .modal-body p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 16px}

  /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
  @media (max-width:1024px){
    .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .side{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-template-rows:none}
    .content-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .sidebar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  }
  @media (max-width:860px){
    .menu-btn{display:grid}
    .main-nav{display:none;position:absolute;top:100%;left:0;right:0;flex-direction:column;height:auto;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:8px 0 14px;overflow:visible}
    .main-nav.open{display:flex}
    .main-nav a{height:46px;border-bottom:0;border-left:3px solid transparent;padding-left:20px}
    .main-nav a.active{border-left-color:var(--red)}
    .search{width:180px}
  }
  @media (max-width:700px){
    .search{display:none}
    .topbar .links{display:none}
    .side{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .video-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .sidebar{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .lead{min-height:380px}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Top Bar -->
  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="container">
      <div id="live-date">Thursday, November 26, 2026 | Dhaka, Bangladesh</div>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="#epaper">e-Paper</a>
        <span class="sep">|</span>
        <a href="#archive">Archive</a>
        <span class="sep">|</span>
        <a href="#english">বাংলা সংস্করণ</a>
        <div class="socials">
          <a href="#" aria-label="Facebook">f</a>
          <a href="#" aria-label="YouTube">▶</a>
          <a href="#" aria-label="X">𝕏</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Site Header -->
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <button class="icon-btn menu-btn" id="menuToggle" aria-label="Menu">☰</button>
      <a href="#" class="logo">
        <div class="logo-mark">DN</div>
        <div class="logo-text">
          DESH <span>NEWS</span>
          <small>Independent. Fearless. 24/7.</small>
        </div>
      </a>
      <div class="header-actions">
        <div class="search">
          <span>🔍</span>
          <input type="search" id="searchInput" placeholder="Search headlines..." aria-label="Search news">
        </div>
        <button class="icon-btn" id="themeToggle" title="Toggle Dark Mode" aria-label="Toggle Dark Mode">🌓</button>
        <button class="live-btn" id="liveTvBtn"><span class="dot"></span> LIVE TV</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Sticky Navigation -->
  <div class="nav-wrap">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="main-nav" id="mainNav">
        <a href="#" class="active" data-cat="all">Home</a>
        <a href="#" data-cat="national">National</a>
        <a href="#" data-cat="politics">Politics</a>
        <a href="#" data-cat="international">International</a>
        <a href="#" data-cat="economy">Economy</a>
        <a href="#" data-cat="sports">Sports</a>
        <a href="#" data-cat="tech">Tech & Science</a>
        <a href="#" data-cat="entertainment">Entertainment</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Breaking News Ticker -->
  <div class="ticker">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ticker-label">Breaking</div>
      <div class="ticker-viewport">
        <div class="ticker-track">
          <div class="ticker-item">Central bank announces new monetary policy framework to curb inflation and stabilize reserves</div>
          <div class="ticker-item">Metro Rail phase-2 expansion receives final cabinet approval with 2028 completion target</div>
          <div class="ticker-item">Bangladesh Cricket Board reveals 16-member squad for upcoming home Test series</div>
          <div class="ticker-item">Global tech summit in Dhaka attracts over 120 international startups and investors</div>
          <div class="ticker-item">Central bank announces new monetary policy framework to curb inflation and stabilize reserves</div>
          <div class="ticker-item">Metro Rail phase-2 expansion receives final cabinet approval with 2028 completion target</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <main class="container">
    <!-- Hero Grid -->
    <section class="hero">
      <article class="lead" data-article="lead">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504711434969-e33886168f5c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Lead News">
        <div class="lead-body">
          <span class="tag">Top Story</span>
          <h1>National Infrastructure Masterplan Unveiled to Connect Regional Economic Zones</h1>
          <p>The multi-billion-dollar corridor project aims to reduce transit times by 40% and boost export capacity across major maritime and land ports.</p>
          <div class="meta">
            <span>By <b>Newsroom Desk</b></span>
            <span>•</span>
            <span>25 mins ago</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="side">
        <article class="side-card" data-article="side1">
          <div class="thumb">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526304640581-d334cdbbf45e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="Economy">
          </div>
          <div class="body">
            <span class="cat">Economy</span>
            <h3>Remittance Inflows Surge 18% Year-on-Year Amid Digital Banking Incentives</h3>
            <div class="meta"><span>1 hour ago</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="side-card" data-article="side2">
          <div class="thumb">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1540747913346-19e32dc3e97e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=80" alt="Sports">
          </div>
          <div class="body">
            <span class="cat">Sports</span>
            <h3>Tigers Gear Up Under Floodlights Ahead of High-Stakes Day-Night Clash</h3>
            <div class="meta"><span>2 hours ago</span></div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

